  (text "U17 loads the opcode in FETCH (/LOAD_INSTR) and holds 02h while RUN is low." (at 40 215 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 845c7282-56a0-52d0-9859-6e8a9db869a5))
  (text "U2's STALL (STALL_IN) goes to the cartridge; STALL_OUT comes back to U1 and the PC." (at 40 219 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5573bfb3-a121-5c59-9b4d-420e5c4b28b0))
  (text "U1 State: FETCH / LOAD / EXEC, register loads (active low, F377 /E), RW (1 = read)." (at 40 223 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 381a3862-4c6a-56e1-94ca-c4ed13ee545f))
  (text "U2 Branch: NEG is AC7.  ALU_DONE (18) and CARRY (20) are internal registers: no connection." (at 40 227 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 50305c40-9102-580a-b8fc-35b50d3fc893))
  (text "Bring-up straps S1-S3 go in U1's socket (BRINGUP.md), not on the board." (at 40 231 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 00574e48-f010-54ff-a507-49ce60430446))
